					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "This page provides an analysis of the memory used by Lepiter databases, using {{gtClass:GtLepiterMemoryMetrics}} for the default logical database and {{gtClass:GtLepiterDatabaseMemoryMetrics}} for each database. See also [[Analysing the size of code-related entities]] and [[Analysing the size of the code index]]."
			},
