				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "For performance reasons the results are cached in {{gtClass:GtLepiterMemoryMetrics}}. Computing them walks over all objects of the databases and can take several seconds. They can be reset using the snippet below."
