					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Databases can also be stored in a class (see {{gtClass:LeDatabaseClassStore}}). Each page is then a method of the storage class, with the JSON of the page in a method comment. The JSON is only in the source files, not in the image. The compiled methods are part of the methods of the image (see [[Analysing the size of code-related entities]]), and are not included in the size of the database. The summary of such a database shows their size separately."
